    "1. Open Home folder in Finder" : {
      "comment" : "A step in the guide to check file permissions.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Finder에서 홈 폴더를 여십시오."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. Press the following button to deactivate driver.\n(The administrator password will be required.)" : {
      "comment" : "A step in the advanced instructions for reactivating the driver.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. 드라이버를 비활성화하려면 아래의 버튼을 누르세요. (관리자 비밀번호가 필요합니다.)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. Press Command + Shift + . (period) to show hidden files" : {
      "comment" : "A step in the guide to check file permissions.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Command + Shift + .(마침표) 를 눌러 숨김 파일을 봅니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. Restart macOS." : {
      "comment" : "A step in the advanced instructions for reactivating the virtual keyboard and mouse driver on macOS.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. macOS를 재시동하세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. After restarting, the driver will be automatically loaded, and the Driver Extensions settings will appear." : {
      "comment" : "A step in the process of reactivating the driver, describing what happens after restarting macOS.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. 재시동 후, 드라이버는 자동으로 로드되고 드라이버 확장 프로그램 설정이 나타납니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. Find .local folder, and choose \"Get Info\" from Menu" : {
      "comment" : "A step in the guide to check file permissions.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. .local 폴더를 찾고, 메뉴에서 “정보 가져오기” 를 선택합니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. Press the following button to activate driver." : {
      "comment" : "A step in the advanced instructions for reinstalling the virtual keyboard and mouse driver.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. 드라이버를 활성화하려면 아래의 버튼을 누르세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "4. \"System Extension Blocked\" alert is shown." : {
      "comment" : "A step in the process of reinstalling the virtual keyboard and mouse driver.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
